# Redirect map — every legacy URL 301s to its canonical (AEO S2 §B).
# No catch-all to index.html: unknown paths must be real 404s, not soft 404s.
/new                 /                       301
/update              /resources/blog/new-system   301
# Blog moved under Resources (E.L., 2026-10-05) — old URLs rank and are linked from SMS/email
/blog                /resources/blog              301
/blog/*              /resources/blog/:splat       301
/404                 /404.html               301
# Crawlers that guess /sitemap.xml get the index (rewrite, not redirect)
/sitemap.xml         /sitemap-index.xml      200

# Second domain (philsmagiccleaning.com) — registrar-level forward is E.L.'s to execute;
# listed here so the map is complete:  philsmagiccleaning.com/*  →  philsmagicclean.com/:splat  301
